  "hsaKiOnboardingIntro": "HSA-GPT (internally \"HAWKI\") is Hochschule Anhalt's own AI service at ki.hs-anhalt.de. Campus Köthen only provides convenient access here — the answers come directly from HSA-GPT, not from Campus Köthen.",
